        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mortgage_amount = 850000\n    is_secured = True\n    loan_date = \"2018-01-10\"\n    filing_status = \"married_jointly\"\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    if not is_secured:\n        raise ValueError(\"Mortgage must be secured to qualify for interest deduction.\")\n\n    if loan_date < \"1987-10-13\":\n        deduction_limit = float(\"inf\")\n    elif loan_date <= \"2017-12-15\":\n        deduction_limit = 1000000\n    else:\n        deduction_limit = 750000\n\n    deductible_interest = min(mortgage_amount, deduction_limit)\n    answer = round(deductible_interest)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
